{"created": "2025-06-03T10:56:04.862861+00:00", "modified": "2025-06-03T10:56:06.135596+00:00", "id": 15537281, "conceptrecid": "15537280", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15537281", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.15537280", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15537281", "metadata": {"title": "INR18650-LG-3500 Cathode EIS Structured Data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15537281", "publication_date": "2025-05-28", "description": "<h1>Scope</h1>\n<p>This record contains electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) measurements of the NMC cathode from an LG CHEM INR18650-MJ1 lithium-ion cell, structured for machine-readable applications. The dataset includes Parquet files with harmonized tabular impedance data, suitable for computational pipelines, and optionally linked data in JSON-LD format for semantic annotation. These measurements were recorded at 25&deg;C and cover both charge and discharge sequences over the full SOC range.</p>\n<h1>Files</h1>\n<h2>Data</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537281/files/18650_LG_3500_MJ1_EIS_cathode_charge.parquet\">18650_LG_3500_MJ1_EIS_cathode_charge.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Structured impedance spectrum of NMC cathode at indicated SOC and 25&deg;C.</td>\n<td>application/parquet</td>\n<td>Use in data science pipelines or impedance modeling.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537281/files/18650_LG_3500_MJ1_EIS_cathode_discharge.parquet\">18650_LG_3500_MJ1_EIS_cathode_discharge.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Structured impedance spectrum of NMC cathode at indicated SOC and 25&deg;C.</td>\n<td>application/parquet</td>\n<td>Use in data science pipelines or impedance modeling.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>RDF Metadata</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537281/files/ro-crate-metadata.json\">ro-crate-metadata.json</a></p>\n</td>\n<td>RDF metadata describing the data table schema, test, and battery</td>\n<td>application/json+ld</td>\n<td>Semantic Web integration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537281/files/ro-crate-preview.html\">ro-crate-preview.html</a></td>\n<td>RDF metadata describing the data table schema, test, and battery</td>\n<td>application/json+ld</td>\n<td>Semantic Web integration</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>Related Resources</h1>\n<table style=\"width: 100.025%; height: 411.6px;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<th style=\"width: 13.9874%; height: 19.6px;\">Relationship</th>\n<th style=\"width: 31.4716%; height: 19.6px;\">Name</th>\n<th style=\"width: 54.5319%; height: 19.6px;\">Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 333.2px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 13.9874%; height: 333.2px;\"><a href=\"https://schema.org/isPartOf\">isPartOf</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.4716%; height: 333.2px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/uploads/15537299\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode Structured Data Collection</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.5319%; height: 333.2px;\">This collection contains records with structured data files representing GITT measurements on the positive electrode (cathode) harvested from an INR18650-MJ1 Li-ion battery cell. The active material in the electrode is NMC. The measurment is obtained in three-electrode configuration with the working electrode NMC, counter electrode composite graphite/silicon oxide, and reference electrode lithium metal in a coin cell casing. The records include raw data obtained from GITT and EIS measurements. The data is intended to be used to charactrize the open-circuit potential and lithium diffusion coefficient in the NMC material to support model-based analysis of MJ1 cells.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39.2px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 13.9874%; height: 39.2px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#continues\">Continues</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.4716%; height: 39.2px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15536917\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode EIS Raw Data</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.5319%; height: 39.2px;\">This record contains Electrochemical Impedance Spectroscopy (EIS) measurements at 25&deg;C of NMC cathodes harvested from an INR18650-MJ1 lithium-ion battery cell manufactured by LG CHEM.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 13.9874%; height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#continues\">Continues</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.4716%; height: 19.6px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15535277\">INR18650-LG-3500 Cathode EIS Data Preprocessing</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.5319%; height: 19.6px;\">This record contains workflows for packaging EIS measurements of an INR18650-MJ1 battery cell cathode from LG CHEM at 25&deg;C.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>Licensing</h1>\n<p>This dataset is licensed under CC-BY 4.0, allowing for sharing and adaptation with proper attribution.</p>\n<h1>Contact Information</h1>\n<p>For questions or further assistance, please contact Dennis Kopljar at dennis.kopljar@dlr.de.</p>\n<h1>References</h1>\n<p>This dataset is linked to the following publication: [DOI/Link to publication].</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kuhn, Yannick", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0002-9019-2290"}, {"name": "Rana, Bhawna", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0001-6403-5139"}, {"name": "Philipp, Micha", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0009-0002-8705-2059"}, {"name": "Schmitt, Christina", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-4095-7611"}, {"name": "Scipioni, Roberto", "affiliation": "SINTEF Energy Research", "orcid": "0000-0003-1926-421X"